      "label":  "1",
      "explanation": "Contains 'We have all the ingredients to make a success of our economy and our society'. This is an aspiration for collective success. 'Make a success of our... society' implies a vision of the common good and national well-being, which often carries moral undertones regarding a people's shared destiny. However, 'ingredients' is a neutral term. I'll mark as 0 because it is just optimism, not explicitly moral. Wait, 'success of our society' could be a value statement. I'll mark as 0 (low confidence)."
